  "details": "Currently, avatar authors have no way of knowing how many people have favourited their creations. Adding visibility into favourite counts would offer meaningful feedback:\n\nCreator Motivation: For smaller and independent creators, seeing that their avatars are being favourited is a powerful source of encouragement and recognition. It would validate the time and effort they invest in their avatar design.\n\nCommunity Insight: Favourite counts give authors a clear picture of how widespread and appreciated their models are within the VRChat community, beyond downloads or private use.\n\nPlatform Growth: By rewarding and motivating creators, VRChat fosters more high quality avatar creation, enriching the ecosystem for all players.\n\nFair Feedback Loop: Instead of relying solely on anecdotal feedback or sales metrics, authors would gain a transparent and direct signal of community engagement.\n\nAuthor-Only Visibility: Favourite counts would be visible only to the avatar’s creator.\n\nThis change would strengthen the bond between creators and the community while incentivizing ongoing creativity.",
